<Layout title="Hilltop Restaurant | Willington, CT"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-content"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#e5cabb">WELCOME TO HILLTOP · WILLINGTON, CT</span><h1>Good food.<br/>Good company.<br/><em>Right at home.</em></h1><p>A neighborhood restaurant, a lively bar, and a place to celebrate. Come as you are, stay a while.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/menu">Explore the Menu</a><a class="button" style="background:transparent;border-color:#fff;color:#fff" href="/banquets">Plan an Event</a></div><p class="hero-note">Professional Hilltop photography coming soon</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">FROM THE GARDEN. FROM THE GRILL.</span><h2>Something for everyone at the table.</h2><p>Steaks, seafood, pizzas, and familiar favorites—made for weeknight dinners, family gatherings, and nights worth lingering over.</p><a class="text-link" href="/menu">Explore our food menu ↗</a></div><div class="photo-placeholder">Hilltop food photography · Coming soon</div></div></section><section class="section" style="background:#eae2d7"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THREE EXPERIENCES · ONE HILLTOP</span><h2>Your place, whatever the occasion.</h2></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><span class="eyebrow">01 · RESTAURANT</span><h3>Gather around the table.</h3><p>From an easy lunch to a dinner with friends, there's always a seat for you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/menu">Food Menu ↗</a></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="eyebrow">02 · BAR & PATIO</span><h3>Pull up a chair.</h3><p>Crafted cocktails, your favorite game, and relaxed evenings indoors or outside.</p><a class="text-link" href="/drinks">Explore Drinks ↗</a></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="eyebrow">03 · BANQUETS</span><h3>Let's celebrate.</h3><p>Showers, birthdays, family milestones, and memorable private gatherings.</p><a class="text-link" href="/banquets">Private Events ↗</a></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="photo-placeholder light">Bar & patio photography · Coming soon</div><div><span class="eyebrow">THE BAR & PATIO</span><h2>One more round, one more story.</h2><p>Whether you're meeting friends, catching the game, or enjoying a warm evening on the patio, make yourself comfortable.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/drinks">View Drinks</a></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#d8baa8">YOUR CELEBRATION, HANDLED</span><h2>Bring everyone together at Hilltop.</h2><p>Explore banquet packages for celebrations big and small.</p><a href="/banquets" class="button button-light">Explore Banquets & Events</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">COME SEE US</span><h2>Find us in Willington.</h2><p>39 Adamec Road<br/>Willington, Connecticut</p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=39+Adamec+Road+Willington+CT" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions ↗</a></div><div class="photo-placeholder light">Exterior photography · Coming soon</div></div></section></Layout>
<style>.hero{min-height:640px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(26,19,16,.9),rgba(47,32,26,.7)),linear-gradient(130deg,#795745,#241b19);display:flex;align-items:center;color:#fff}.hero-content{padding:85px 0}.hero h1{max-width:850px;margin:18px 0}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#e6d4c0}.hero p{max-width:510px;font-size:1.1rem}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}.hero-note{margin-top:75px!important;font-size:.67rem!important;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:600px){.hero{min-height:550px}.hero-content{padding:55px 0}}</style>
